  "description": "Fitted to a clean recording of the machine, BD 909 Clean Medium C 03 (TR-909 From Mars): Decay, Tune and Attack at mid. A 27-semitone sweep (about 190 Hz at 5 ms, 155 Hz at 10 ms) down to 49 Hz on C4, the recording's settled pitch; the body holds 60 ms, then falls over 200 ms. A biased drive makes the body lopsided, its negative half-cycles taller, and a zero-attack square edge opens it on a negative step. Even; the bass drum of harder techno.",
